<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #56ab2f 0%, #a8e063 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #fff; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e1e8ed; }
    .response-box { background: #f0f9ff; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #56ab2f; border-radius: 4px; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #657786; font-size: 12px; }
    .tracking { background: #fff3cd; padding: 10px 15px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🎉 您的反馈已处理</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <p>尊敬的 <strong><%= @feedback.submitter_name %></strong>，</p>
      
      <p>您的反馈（追踪号：<span class="tracking"><%= @feedback.tracking_number %></span>）已经处理完成！</p>
      
      <h4 style="color: #56ab2f;">原始反馈：</h4>
      <p><strong><%= @feedback.subject %></strong></p>
      
      <% if @feedback.response.present? %>
        <h4 style="color: #56ab2f;">我们的回复：</h4>
        <div class="response-box">
          <%= simple_format(@feedback.response) %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
      
      <p>再次感谢您的宝贵反馈，您的意见帮助我们不断改进！</p>
      
      <p>如果您有任何疑问，欢迎随时联系我们。</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>联系我们：<a href="mailto:support@craftlet.com">support@craftlet.com</a></p>
      <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Craftlet. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
